thing]]. [[The]] [[body]] [[is|be]] an [[old]] [[computer]] [[box]]. [[The]] [[head]] [[is|be]] Grandma's [[old]] [[telephone]]. [[The]] [[legs|leg]] [[come]] [[from]] an [[old]] [[chair]].`,`vn`:`Hai anh em kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ti\u1ec1n, n\u00ean h\u1ecd d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed3 c\u0169. Th\u00e2n robot l\u00e0 v\u1ecf m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u0169. \u0110\u1ea7u l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfc \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i b\u00e0n c\u0169 c\u1ee7a b\u00e0. Ch\u00e2n l\u1ea5y t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc gh\u1ebf c\u0169.`},{`en`:`Mi [[goes|go]] [[online]] [[every]] [[night]]. [[She]] [[learns|learn]] [[fast]] [[from]] [[the]] [[internet]]. [[When]] [[there]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[problem]], [[she]] [[writes|write]] an [[email]] [[to]] [[the]] [[scientist]]. [[One]] [[morning]], [[there]] [[is|be]] an [[email]] [[on]] Mi's [[phone]]: \`[[Good]] [[work]]! [[Try]] [[again]]!\``,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i n\u00e0o Mi c\u0169ng l\u00ean m\u1ea1ng. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 h\u1ecdc r\u1ea5t nhanh nh\u1edd internet. C\u00f3 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 g\u00ec, c\u00f4 b\u00e9 l\u1ea1i vi\u1ebft email cho nh\u00e0 khoa h\u1ecdc. M\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i s\u00e1ng, \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a Mi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ed9t email: \`L\u00e0m t\u1ed1t l\u1eafm! Th\u1eed l\u1ea1i nh\u00e9!\``},{`en`:`[[Their]] [[dad]], Mr Khai, [[puts|put]] [[two]] [[small]] [[lights|light]] [[in]] [[the]] [[robot's|robot]] [[eyes|eye]]. [[Then]] [[there]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[sound]] [[from]] [[the]] [[telephone]] [[head]]: \`Brring! Brring!\` [[Dad]] [[answers|answer]] [[it]]. \`[[Hello]]?\` [[Nobody]] [[is|be]] [[there]]. Mi [[laughs|laugh]] [[so]] [[much]] [[that]] [[she]] [[falls|fall]] [[off]] [[her]] [[chair]].`,`vn`:`B\u1ed1 c\u1ee7a hai anh em, ch\u00fa Kh\u1ea3i, l\u1eafp hai chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n nh\u1ecf l\u00e0m m\u1eaft cho robot. \u0110\u00fang l\u00fac \u1ea5y, c\u00e1i \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i b\u1ed7ng reo: \`Reng! Reng!\` B\u1ed1 nh\u1ea5c m\u00e1y. \`A l\u00f4?\` Ch\u1eb3ng c\u00